Z||000013||mwbackus||09-24-1999||12:36 PM||||Heh Fast, those $400 units are not tuned headers, they are not even equal length.  The $500 ones, on the other hand, are more comparible to the FOCOA offerings, although I bet ya getem in your hands sooner. :-) <BR>I have nothing but respect for Chris, he is an outstanding good guy.  I just thought I should point this out, so you dont get something other than what you intended on.<P>Mike||||reg||1
Z||000014||DXR_DAD||09-24-1999||03:18 PM||||All of these post have good points, an exhaust manifold is a header?? NOT a tuned header. For the price and the hp gain the re-weld and port made more sence to me. I`ve heard 8-15 hp from the port job, but it is still up to you and what you want to do. Just a well running fiero with a little go to it at the best price....turbo thats something else??  Like the age old saying " what came first the turbo or the headers???<P>My 0.02 is in!!||||reg||1
