Z||000028||mwbackus||10-01-1999||07:32 AM||||These are tuned, equal length headers for the 2.8L Fiero (from Sabex Racing), and may increase hp significantly:<P> <IMG SRC="http://web.idirect.com/~sabex/ep/header.jpg"> <P><BR>These are "performance manifolds" (from the Fiero Store) and probably wont increase hp significantly:<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fierostore.com/product/exh&emm/images/95727.gif"> <P><BR>The only tuned, equal length headers that I know of are offered by :<P>FOCOA <A HREF="http://www.fieroowners.com/store.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroowners.com/store.html</A> <P>West Coast Fieros (the $500 units) <A HREF="http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/Exhaust/Exhaust.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.earthlink.net/~chriswest/Exhaust/Exhaust.html</A> <P>Sabex Racing <A HREF="http://web.idirect.com/~sabex/eng_per.html" TARGET=_blank>http://web.idirect.com/~sabex/eng_per.html</A> <P><BR>Mike||||reg||1
