Z||000030||fastonpumpgas||10-01-1999||09:49 PM||||Well there is no doubt that unless you do the heads and a free flow system ,there is no sense in buying the good headers.  Since I work at a automotive machine shop, I am going to port my manifolds first, taking the weld out and the "T's" in the 3,4,5, and 6 tubes (if you look down in there you will see what I am talking about) , I have heard 8 HP is no unheard of, where as sprint headers are only good for about 15 to 20 HP.  I will try them both and let you know how it ends up . I have a new crossover and catback and ported exhaust.  hopefully I wil have my baby back to gether b4 it gets to cold !!||||reg||1
